[en.FOCUS_C18_100_REINCARNATION]
Protocol <=Reincarnation=>

[en.FOCUS_C18_100_REINCARNATION_desc]
In the end, the Kirins had to face the worst result. The goal of the Protocol <=Reincarnation=> was to allow the Kirins to maintain an organized civilization even after a complete Nirikization in a short period of time, just like the ancient civilization of Nan Du. We all understand that the civilization that has been completely Nirikized will inevitably decline and perish, but we are betting all our hopes on what comes after that — our descendants will have the opportunity to rebuild a new civilization.\nThe designers of the protocol could not imagine what kind of strong enemy the Kirins would face at that time. They only knew that the flame that had cursed the Kirin tribe for thousands of years was also their blessing.

[en.FOCUS_C18_100_REINCARNATION_TOOLTIP]
Unlock decison in §YDream by the Fire§!: §0Total Nirikization§!

[zh.FOCUS_C18_100_REINCARNATION]
「轮回」协议

[zh.FOCUS_C18_100_REINCARNATION_desc]
最终，麒麟们不得不面对最坏的结果。「轮回」协议的设计目标就是让麒麟们在彻底逆麟化后在短时间内依然能够保持有组织的文明，一如曾经的南都文明。虽然全面逆麟化的文明将不可避免地堕落、消亡，但我们将全部的希望押注在那之后 —— 我们的后代能够有机会重建一个新的文明。\n协议的设计者无法想象那时的麒麟们将要面对什么样的强敌。他们只知道，诅咒麒麟族数千年的烈火，也是他们的祝福。

[zh.FOCUS_C18_100_REINCARNATION_TOOLTIP]
解锁§Y黄粱一梦§!中的决议：§0全面逆麟化§!

